<h1>New answer to your question</h1>
<p>Hello, <%= @user.name %>!</p>
<p>A new answer was posted to the question “<strong><%= @question.title %></strong>”:</p>
<blockquote>
  <%= simple_format @answer.body %>
</blockquote>
<p>
  Go to the question: <%= link_to 'Open', question_url(@question) %>
</p>
